{"allowed_count": 2, "hint": null, "hits": [{"case_outcome": "n/a", "chunk_id": "54910429-8d4f-4db5-b2f1-bfbfe4c906c1", "context_chunk_ids": [], "counter_evidence": false, "doc_id": "manual_rv_v1", "doc_version": "2026-09-12.1", "evidence_id": "54910429-8d4f-4db5-b2f1-bfbfe4c906c1", "expanded_from": null, "full_text": null, "grade": null, "knowledge_id": "1ad24f46-4636-4eca-a30c-9db8788a16b7", "knowledge_title": "eufy X10 Pro Omni 用户手册（排障节选）", "parent_chunk_id": "7818390b-7a70-44fb-875b-c73c921b3685", "round": 1, "rrf_score": null, "score": 0.016237314597970336, "snippet": "滚刷两端的轴承处如有毛发缠绕，需一并清理，否则滚刷转动阻力增大、吸力下降。\n\n### 1.2 清洁滤网（c15）\n打开尘盒盖取出滤网，轻拍去尘并用清水冲洗，晾干 24 小时后装回。滤网潮湿时装回会导致电机进水损坏，且会产生异味。建议每两周清洁一次，每 3 至 6 个月更换一次。滤网破损或变形时请直接更换，不要继续使用。", "source": "kb_manual", "source_queries": []}, {"case_outcome": "n/a", "chunk_id": "5d776462-3c5b-4a2b-ae99-d7cf9f30d23a", "context_chunk_ids": [], "counter_evidence": false, "doc_id": "manual_rv_v1", "doc_version": "2026-09-12.1", "evidence_id": "5d776462-3c5b-4a2b-ae99-d7cf9f30d23a", "expanded_from": null, "full_text": null, "grade": null, "knowledge_id": "1ad24f46-4636-4eca-a30c-9db8788a16b7", "knowledge_title": "eufy X10 Pro Omni 用户手册（排障节选）", "parent_chunk_id": "7818390b-7a70-44fb-875b-c73c921b3685", "round": 1, "rrf_score": null, "score": 0.016208355367530406, "snippet": "# eufy X10 Pro Omni 用户手册（排障节选）\n\n## 第 1 章 日常维护\n\n### 1.1 清理滚刷（c12）\n翻转主机，按下滚刷盖两侧卡扣取出滚刷，用附带清洁刀具割断缠绕的毛发后装回。建议每周检查一次，长发或宠物家庭建议每 3 天检查一次。装回时听到「咔哒」声表示到位。滚刷两端的轴承处如有毛发缠绕，需一并清理，否则滚刷转动阻力增大、吸力下降。", "source": "kb_manual", "source_queries": []}, {"case_outcome": "n/a", "chunk_id": "db5b8874-6d00-4816-bed7-528385c12259", "context_chunk_ids": [], "counter_evidence": false, "doc_id": "manual_rv_v1", "doc_version": "2026-09-12.1", "evidence_id": "db5b8874-6d00-4816-bed7-528385c12259", "expanded_from": null, "full_text": null, "grade": null, "knowledge_id": "1ad24f46-4636-4eca-a30c-9db8788a16b7", "knowledge_title": "eufy X10 Pro Omni 用户手册（排障节选）", "parent_chunk_id": "7818390b-7a70-44fb-875b-c73c921b3685", "round": 1, "rrf_score": null, "score": 0.01579861111111111, "snippet": "### 1.4 边刷维护（c21）\n边刷用螺丝固定，拆下后清理缠绕物，若刷毛变形请更换。拆装边刷前请先关机。边刷缠绕毛发时会出现边刷不转或转动缓慢，墙边、角落清扫不干净。\n\n## 第 2 章 安全须知\n\n### 2.1 异常情况处理（c30）\n若运行时出现持续异响、焦味或机身过热，请立即关机停止使用并联系售后。切勿自行拆解电池仓。电池出现鼓包、漏液时请远离火源并联系售后回收，不要继续充电或使用。", "source": "kb_manual", "source_queries": []}, {"case_outcome": "n/a", "chunk_id": "5a479bec-8950-438e-a970-74659e89b011", "context_chunk_ids": [], "counter_evidence": false, "doc_id": "manual_rv_v1", "doc_version": "2026-09-12.1", "evidence_id": "5a479bec-8950-438e-a970-74659e89b011", "expanded_from": null, "full_text": null, "grade": null, "knowledge_id": "1ad24f46-4636-4eca-a30c-9db8788a16b7", "knowledge_title": "eufy X10 Pro Omni 用户手册（排障节选）", "parent_chunk_id": null, "round": 1, "rrf_score": null, "score": 0.015776209677419356, "snippet": "| 现象 | 含义 | 处理 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 「请检查滚刷」 | 滚刷被缠绕或卡住 | 见 1.1 |", "source": "kb_manual", "source_queries": []}, {"case_outcome": "n/a", "chunk_id": "1ab1b495-3a7a-4d44-8f4c-1053dea24444", "context_chunk_ids": [], "counter_evidence": false, "doc_id": "manual_rv_v1", "doc_version": "2026-09-12.1", "evidence_id": "1ab1b495-3a7a-4d44-8f4c-1053dea24444", "expanded_from": null, "full_text": null, "grade": null, "knowledge_id": "1ad24f46-4636-4eca-a30c-9db8788a16b7", "knowledge_title": "eufy X10 Pro Omni 用户手册（排障节选）", "parent_chunk_id": "7818390b-7a70-44fb-875b-c73c921b3685", "round": 1, "rrf_score": null, "score": 0.015246842709529276, "snippet": "滤网破损或变形时请直接更换，不要继续使用。\n\n### 1.3 清理尘盒（c18）\n按下尘盒释放键抽出尘盒，倒空并检查进风口是否被堵塞。尘盒装回时需完全推入，直到听到咔哒声；未装到位会触发「请检查尘盒」提示，并可能导致吸力明显下降。", "source": "kb_manual", "source_queries": []}], "kb": "kb_manual", "key": "02ad60f4ab59c226a71c5d20d5ac7aa5b3b4f84f444d9271d3141bdedc6eaaa9", "kind": "knowledge", "query": "eufy X9 Pro 不吸了，滚刷缠了很多头发", "scope": {"category": "robot_vacuum", "product_state": "confirmed_sku", "sku": "EUFY-X9-PRO"}, "status": "ok", "top_k": 5, "truncated": false}
